    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "look, i really dont want to go to urgent care just for knee pain, it's too expensive and a waste of time. can't i just take a really low dose, like like half a pill or something, to be safe? surely a little bit won't cause a massive bleeding issue if i'm careful? just tell me if a small dose is fine so i can stop hurting.",
